@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceReferenceBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
hide footbox
title Fee statement: validate the request
mainframe **sd** validate request and build statement

participant ":PaymentCommands" as Commands
participant ":TutorLedgerData" as Data

activate Commands
Commands -> Commands : validate exactly one student ID
activate Commands
Commands --> Commands : student ID, or usage error
deactivate Commands

alt missing or extra argument
  Commands -->[ : usage error
else one student ID
  Commands -> Data : getStudent("S1")
  activate Data
  Data --> Commands : student or lookup error
  deactivate Data
  alt student exists
    ref over Commands, Data : collect and format statement rows
    Commands -->[ : statement or empty-history message
  else invalid or unknown student ID
    Commands -->[ : student error
  end
end
deactivate Commands
@enduml
